[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21481.948, "timestamp": "05:58:01", "text": "我们弄到了食物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21488.11, "timestamp": "05:58:08", "text": "耶。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21490.47, "timestamp": "05:58:10", "text": "看。那是我想的那样吗？那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21502.27, "timestamp": "05:58:22", "text": "木头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21513.51, "timestamp": "05:58:33", "text": "那我们该怎么处置这个运动员呢？是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21521.11, "timestamp": "05:58:41", "text": "豆子。拿到那块必不可少的石头"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21522.83, "timestamp": "05:58:42", "text": "为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21525.43, "timestamp": "05:58:45", "text": "我。你们如何处理空罐子？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21534.83, "timestamp": "05:58:54", "text": "嗯，就是这些床单之类的东西，对吧？碎屑。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21537.75, "timestamp": "05:58:57", "text": "请问你用的是哪款显卡？"}]